\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Spirit of faith, come down,
\par Reveal  the things of God;
\par And make to us the Godhead known,
\par And witness with the blood.
\par 'Tis Thine the blood to apply,
\par And give us eyes to see
\par Who did for every sinner die
\par Hath surely died for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. No man can truly say
\par That Jesus is the Lord,
\par Unless Thou take the veil away,
\par And breathe the living word;
\par Then, only then, we feel
\par Our interest in His blood,
\par And cry, with joy unspeakable:
\par Thou art my Lord, my God!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O that the world might know
\par The all-atoning Lamb!
\par Spirit of faith, descend, and show
\par The virtue of His name;
\par The grace which all may find,
\par The saving power impart;
\par And testify to all mankind,
\par And speak in every heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Inspire the living faith,
\par Which whosoe'er receives,
\par The witness in himself he hath,
\par And consciously believes;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The faith that conquers all,
\par And doth the mountain move,
\par And saves whoe'er on Jesus call,
\par And perfects them in love.
\par                      Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
